<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Frame-Time on STEP Batch 12</title><link>https://step-12.github.io/tags/frame-time/</link><description>Recent content in Frame-Time on STEP Batch 12</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en_US</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:14:18 +0530</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://step-12.github.io/tags/frame-time/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Movement and Frame Time</title><link>https://step-12.github.io/posts/raylib/frame_time/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 09:00:00 +0530</pubDate><guid>https://step-12.github.io/posts/raylib/frame_time/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="is-the-dinosaur-always-this-fast"&gt;Is the dinosaur always this fast?&lt;a class="anchor" href="#is-the-dinosaur-always-this-fast"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;In the fourth part of &lt;a href="https://step-12.github.io/assignments/dino_run/#4-what-goes-up"&gt;The Long Run&lt;/a&gt;, we gave the dinosaur a velocity and gravity.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Your code may look different, but somewhere it probably does something like this:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-js" data-lang="js"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;dino&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;velocityY&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;-=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;dino&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;gravity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;dino&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;y&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;-=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;dino&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;velocityY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The velocity changes on every update. The position changes on every update too.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This produces a jump, but there is a problem hiding in it.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="try-this-before-reading-further"&gt;Try this before reading further&lt;a class="anchor" href="#try-this-before-reading-further"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Find this line in your game:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>